{"preface":["书名:小天狼星陪哈利长大(别名:哈利波特：与教父同行)","作者:圣诞蛋糕刀","简介:","双男主/犬狼/德哈/蛇院哈/非重生/原著时间线/HP","——","在哈利的11岁暑假，教父从天而降。","哈利结束了在女贞路的生活，来到了格里莫广场12号。","与此同时，生活落魄的卢平收到了来自昔日好友的信件。误会与思念在重逢后孕育出新的感情。","为了洗清自己的冤屈，为好友复仇，小天狼星布莱克踏上了漫漫长路。","在见到逝去父母的雕像后，分院帽将哈利分进斯莱特林，在教父的陪伴下，哈利开启了不同寻常的救世主生涯。","立场的对立，让哈利和德拉科之间的关系晦暗不明","——————————————-","破镜重圆成年组[犬狼]+两小无猜未成年组[德哈]","—————————-"],"chapters":[{"title":"第1章 chapter01","paragraphs":36},{"title":"第2章 chapter02","paragraphs":42},{"title":"第3章 chapter03","paragraphs":43},{"title":"第4章 chapter04","paragraphs":40},{"title":"第5章 chapter05","paragraphs":53},{"title":"第6章 chapter06","paragraphs":40},{"title":"第7章 chapter07","paragraphs":73},{"title":"第8章 chapter08","paragraphs":22},{"title":"第9章 chapter09","paragraphs":15},{"title":"第10章 chapter10","paragraphs":42},{"title":"第11章 chapter11","paragraphs":18},{"title":"第12章 chapter12","paragraphs":51},{"title":"第13章 chapter13","paragraphs":24},{"title":"第14章 chapter14","paragraphs":32},{"title":"第15章 chapter15","paragraphs":43},{"title":"第16章 chapter16","paragraphs":31},{"title":"第17章 chapter17","paragraphs":39},{"title":"第18章 chapter18","paragraphs":19},{"title":"第19章 chapter19","paragraphs":36},{"title":"第20章 chapter20","paragraphs":30},{"title":"第21章 chapter21","paragraphs":42},{"title":"第22章 chapter22","paragraphs":35},{"title":"第23章 chapter23","paragraphs":35},{"title":"第24章 chapter24","paragraphs":38},{"title":"第25章 chapter25","paragraphs":55},{"title":"第26章 chapter26","paragraphs":46},{"title":"第27章 chapter27","paragraphs":39},{"title":"第28章 chapter28","paragraphs":15},{"title":"第29章 chapter29","paragraphs":40},{"title":"第30章 chapter30","paragraphs":36},{"title":"第31章 chapter31","paragraphs":57},{"title":"第32章 chapter32","paragraphs":23},{"title":"第33章 chapter33","paragraphs":30},{"title":"第34章 chapter34","paragraphs":36},{"title":"第35章 chapter35","paragraphs":27},{"title":"第36章 chapter36","paragraphs":46},{"title":"第37章 chapter37","paragraphs":75},{"title":"第38章 chapter38","paragraphs":19},{"title